// Curated, developer-facing text for every endpoint in the public reference.
// The endpoint list (method, path, auth, params) comes from data/api-catalogue.json,
// which is generated by Graft; this file only adds the prose. The generator fails
// when an endpoint has no entry here, so a new route cannot ship undocumented.

